spans.s:
सं-√ घट् Ā. -घटते, to assemble together, meet, Rājat.;
to meet, encounter, Siṃhās. :
Caus. -घाटयति or -घटयति, to cause to assemble, collect, Kathās.;
to join or fasten together, Sarvad.;
to strike (a musical instrument), R. :
Intens. -जाघटीति, to be well fitted or adapted for anything, ib.

सं-√ घट्ट् Ā. -घट्टते, to strike or clasp or rub together, knead, crush to pieces, bruise, R. :
Caus. -घट्टयति (ind.p. -घट्टय्य), to cause to rub against (instr.), Ragh.;
to stir, AgP.;
to strike against, touch, MBh.;
to cause to sound by striking, R.;
to bring together, collect, assemble, MBh.; Rājat.;
to meet, encounter, Naiṣ.

सं-√ घृष् P. -घर्षति, to rub together or against each other, contend or vie with (instr.), MBh.; Ragh. :
Pass. -घृष्यते, to be rubbed or wetted (as a sword), Subh.;
 (pr. p. -घृष्यत्), to be brought or come into collision, vie or rival with (also with परस्-परम्), MBh.
